# How an engagement runs
{.lead} A probe for the mdp:timeline block: a vertical sequence of steps, each a title and a short body, on one accent rail.

```mdp:timeline
# Brief
We turn a short brief and a few questions into a scoped plan.

# Build
A working MVP in hours to days, not weeks.

# Review
You see it running, and we iterate on what matters.

# Ship
One file, deployed and measured.
```
